WEBVTT

02:08:34.032 --> 02:08:37.249
Does he know how much he's making everyone eat fire?

02:08:39.707 --> 02:08:41.687
Isn't what you did unjust, Annie?

02:08:41.742 --> 02:08:43.893
How much would he have craved this child?

02:08:43.918 --> 02:08:45.536
Be it unjust or cruel,

02:08:46.307 --> 02:08:47.882
I can't abandon him.

02:08:48.398 --> 02:08:50.037
For him I am just a tool

02:08:50.531 --> 02:08:53.977
But ...
I am a mother.

02:08:54.556 --> 02:08:56.514
Now, we will have our own children

02:08:56.711 --> 02:08:57.795
So?

02:08:58.289 --> 02:09:01.656
This child who was the first to grow inside me,
will he not remain my son?

02:09:04.519 --> 02:09:05.944
The mistake is mine,

02:09:07.078 --> 02:09:09.783
I did not need this second life.

02:09:11.025 --> 02:09:12.493
The price I paid for this?

02:09:12.645 --> 02:09:15.777
Das!
Yes Annie, Das is also a husband.

02:09:17.567 --> 02:09:23.942
A husband who had the misfortune
of witnessing his own wife bear another man's child.

02:09:25.183 --> 02:09:27.376
Self-esteem was sacrificed that day.

02:09:28.148 --> 02:09:29.872
My ears from the mockery.

02:09:30.815 --> 02:09:34.436
To the locals, do you know who Chandra Das now is?

02:09:35.075 --> 02:09:39.371
A man who made his wife someone else's concubine.
And being able to eat because of that. A gentleman.

02:09:41.475 --> 02:09:47.764
Like a certificate of my misfortune,
I won't be able to stand this burden being with us for the rest of our lives.

02:09:50.704 --> 02:09:53.457
Then,
you can abandon me Das.

02:09:58.000 --> 02:09:59.831
I will carry this burden alone.

02:10:00.688 --> 02:10:04.012
After one more year,
you will be able to enter the field again Das.

02:10:05.061 --> 02:10:06.870
Become a proud star for the fans.

02:10:07.984 --> 02:10:11.286
But Annie and her son will not come there
as a certificate of your humilation.

02:10:49.207 --> 02:10:50.931
Remain calm Rajeev.

02:10:51.337 --> 02:10:52.933
We can find a way.

02:10:53.403 --> 02:10:55.084
Yes! Why fear needlessly

02:10:55.343 --> 02:10:57.729
Just now I brought you on bail so easily.

02:10:58.287 --> 02:11:00.502
And that too considering all the charges.

02:11:00.847 --> 02:11:02.869
Intimidation, ???

02:11:03.300 --> 02:11:06.351
If it was another advocate,
there would've been an order to put you in remand.

02:11:06.799 --> 02:11:08.118
That would've been better.

02:11:08.676 --> 02:11:12.430
Life imprisonment with no chance to leave early.

02:11:22.148 --> 02:11:24.896
Advocate, will we get the child back?

02:11:25.114 --> 02:11:28.096
We must get it.
The case might be complicated.

02:11:28.783 --> 02:11:30.486
We can argue with two points.

02:11:31.172 --> 02:11:34.943
Firstly, breach of contract.
Acting contrary to the agreement.

02:11:35.395 --> 02:11:37.226
Then, cheating.
Betrayal of trust.

02:11:38.073 --> 02:11:40.927
Isn't there a legal way of claiming the child?

02:11:41.039 --> 02:11:44.661
Isn't that the contract?
This contract's strength is our strength.

02:11:45.578 --> 02:11:49.158
We wrote this then only on my insistence!
And if we hadn't?

02:11:50.625 --> 02:11:56.700
This advocate Govindan is only called ??? by ???.
No one with brains will do that. What do you say?

02:11:56.918 --> 02:11:58.877
That we can say after the case is over.

02:11:59.243 --> 02:12:02.089
You too must come to the court.
As a witness.

02:12:03.416 --> 02:12:12.585
It is based on this ??? contract, that the
second party is now keeping the child in their custody.

02:12:12.653 --> 02:12:17.193
That is a breach of contract under Section 406 of the Indian Contract Act.

02:12:17.817 --> 02:12:19.925
Two lakh rupees in cash was received.

02:12:20.228 --> 02:12:25.664
Rejecting all terms agreed to verbally and in writing by the other party, is a betrayal of trust.

02:12:25.945 --> 02:12:29.034
Cheating.
Section 420 of the IPC.

02:12:29.268 --> 02:12:37.008
I humbly request the court to take action
to return the child to my honest client. ???

02:12:37.247 --> 02:12:38.416
That's all Your Honour.

02:12:43.635 --> 02:12:47.855
Your Honour.
My client does not reject the contract terms mentioned earlier.

02:12:48.642 --> 02:12:56.957
But for artifical insemination, and for the actions
taken by the first party, there is no legal basis in India.

02:12:57.512 --> 02:13:02.265
And so, ???
this contract is invalid.

02:13:02.739 --> 02:13:04.037
It is an illegal contract.

02:13:04.198 --> 02:13:05.645
My client is married.

02:13:06.331 --> 02:13:07.948
Her husband is still alive.

02:13:08.186 --> 02:13:13.526
So, legally possession of this child
is assigned to my client's husband.

02:13:13.743 --> 02:13:15.296
Marriage certificate is produced.

02:13:15.727 --> 02:13:18.304
So I request Your Honour, to set aside the contract.

02:13:18.543 --> 02:13:20.289
That's all Your Honour.
Thank you.

02:13:30.058 --> 02:13:32.636
This agreement is against the Indian Contract Act.

02:13:32.768 --> 02:13:34.747
So the petition is rejected.

02:13:38.672 --> 02:13:41.015
Your Honour,
as a special case?

02:13:42.506 --> 02:13:45.702
Sir, everything stated in the petition is true.

02:13:46.473 --> 02:13:47.579
I don't know the law.

02:13:47.796 --> 02:13:50.268
But he is my son!
You must give him to me!

02:13:50.474 --> 02:13:54.118
What you are saying might be true.
But legally there is no possibility.

02:13:54.677 --> 02:13:56.188
You can appeal anywhere.

02:13:56.469 --> 02:13:59.515
But no court in India will consider this.

02:14:12.617 --> 02:14:13.978
What are you thinking?

02:14:15.625 --> 02:14:17.413
I was thinking about Rajeev.

02:14:17.950 --> 02:14:21.679
When the court said the contract is illegal,
he became very despondent.

02:14:22.686 --> 02:14:23.962
God is with me.

02:14:24.307 --> 02:14:26.732
Then, God is unjust.

02:14:26.961 --> 02:14:29.261
You're still unable to understand me, Das.

02:14:29.671 --> 02:14:34.339
I know.
But, I can understand everyone.

02:14:34.470 --> 02:14:38.371
You have hatred for my son.
That's why you're speaking for him.

02:14:38.566 --> 02:14:39.970
It's not hatred, Annie.

02:14:43.985 --> 02:14:47.650
I had desired to share my life with you.

02:14:48.316 --> 02:14:50.168
Didn't you just now say <i>my</i> son?

02:14:51.268 --> 02:14:54.080
He can only be your son.
He can't be our son.

02:15:00.098 --> 02:15:03.059
He will always only be your son.

02:15:04.087 --> 02:15:06.301
And I will be alone.

02:15:07.500 --> 02:15:09.160
I can't stand that Annie.

02:15:09.953 --> 02:15:15.602
Do not think like that.
You will always be with me Das. You must.

02:15:16.206 --> 02:15:21.502
Isn't that why I did something that
no other woman would do?

02:15:22.730 --> 02:15:26.225
I didn't know that I would come to love this child.

02:15:27.445 --> 02:15:31.024
When he grows up, will he not go in search of his father?

02:15:31.242 --> 02:15:36.080
No, my son will not leave me.

02:15:45.948 --> 02:15:49.059
Else, let him leave if he wants to.

02:15:49.489 --> 02:15:52.514
Until then, he is our son.

02:15:53.301 --> 02:15:58.353
My Das will be his father.
Will you not love him like a child, Das?

02:15:58.975 --> 02:16:02.492
Don't cry Annie.
Don't cry.

02:16:19.290 --> 02:16:21.803
You've gone back to your old ways?

02:16:22.766 --> 02:16:24.618
Yes.

02:16:26.389 --> 02:16:30.480
The restart went beautifully.
No issues.

02:16:33.657 --> 02:16:35.851
There's one thing that will make you happy.

02:16:36.131 --> 02:16:40.863
Don't you say that these assets will all get taken by others.

02:16:41.486 --> 02:16:43.316
Don't need to fear that now.

02:16:44.643 --> 02:16:46.239
My son.

02:16:47.010 --> 02:16:48.499
This will all be his.

02:16:48.995 --> 02:16:51.145
Come, go to bed.
- No.

02:16:52.407 --> 02:16:54.558
I was resting all this while.

02:16:57.800 --> 02:17:00.932
Enjoyed a dream while sleeping.

02:17:03.426 --> 02:17:04.872
Eight to ten months.

02:17:06.220 --> 02:17:07.688
That's gone.

02:17:09.036 --> 02:17:12.296
In a way, it was good
that it happend like this.

02:17:13.324 --> 02:17:16.904
Because ...
he won't be like me.

02:17:17.846 --> 02:17:19.612
He'll get everything I didn't.

02:17:20.193 --> 02:17:21.213
A good mother.

02:17:21.893 --> 02:17:22.593


